Finding addressed: host-001 — when concept 'halve': "idempotency key" has no mapping in the architecture (check: term-mappings).

The term is already declared in the product document: `glossary` carries `idempotency key` — "The request label supplied with a halving. Repeating a halving with the same idempotency key changes the number only once." — and the `when` concept `halve` lists it under `terms`. Nothing in the product document needs to change. Only `architecture.terms` is missing the mapping, so this is a single edit to the architecture document. No Scenario, generated test or step definition is touched.

Apply exactly one edit to `./docs/architecture/architecture.yaml`:

