      {
        "term": "idempotency key",
        "technical": "The text value held in the Calc page \"Idempotency key\" textbox, which the UI sends with the halving request and uses to suppress a repeated halving of the same label",
        "observed_by": "The when step definition types a fresh label into the Calc page \"Idempotency key\" textbox before pressing Halve, and for a repeated request types the same label again, so the key is set up by the step rather than asserted on"
      }
